							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The importer walks the AST in three ways: `kotlinAstsDo:` (files, namespaces), `withAllNodesOfType:` (classes) and a separate visitor, {{gtClass:GtSmaCCKotlinClassPartsImporter}} (members). `addInheritedTypes` scans `model allTypes` instead."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-22T00:50:07.144822+03:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-22T00:50:07.144822+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "UGJ/qfsTQ5iiL/UD3pAa/A=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "It keeps context in three ways: AST attributes (`#famixFile`, `#container`, found again by walking parents in `containerIn:`), the FAMIX entity's `#ast` property (read by type lookup and `addInheritedTypes`), and the visitor's `currentContainer`/`currentMethod` slots."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-22T00:50:07.164505+03:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-22T00:50:07.164505+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "C0HIrNPeRLKWI2hZTZe75Q=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Attributes written in one pass and read in another make the order of the passes an unstated contract. The crashes fixed on 2026-10-20 all came from it: a namespace has no `#ast`, a file without a package has no `#container`, a function has no `parentType`."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-22T00:50:07.215848+03:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-10-23T02:16:38.067107+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "r0rOiuYFRmW6bwkRjyiqeg=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:GtSmaCCJavaImporter}} works the same way (`withAllNodesDo:`, an `isKindOf:` chain, `containerIn:`). {{gtClass:GtPythonImporter}} and {{gtClass:GtJSImporter}} are themselves visitors with a `scopeStack` ({{gtMethod:GtPythonImporter>>assignScope:around:}}). They create classes by plain name on first mention (`classes at:ifAbsentPut:`), and record `node -> scope` pairs during the walk ({{gtMethod:GtPythonImporter>>visitFunctionCallExpression:}}) that they resolve after each file (`finishImportingFile`), not after all files. {{gtClass:GtRubyImporter}} records `{ class. superclassName }` pairs during the walk and resolves them once every AST has been walked ({{gtMethod:GtRubyImporter>>importASTs:}}); that is the model for deferred resolution here."
						}
					]
				},
