							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "During the walk, entities have no declared types or superclasses yet; anything that needs them must run after resolution. Signatures are one case: `addMethodSignature:` reads parameter types, and `FAMIXMethod`/`FAMIXFunction` build their `mooseName` from the signature, so signatures are built in `addMethodSignatures` after `resolveTypeReferences`."
						},
