								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Applying it is a refactoring in six steps, with all `GtSmaCCKotlinExamples` green after each: importer becomes the visitor; scope stack; deferred type resolution; classes created in `visitClassDeclaration:`; files and namespaces in `visitFile:`; a single `storeAST:into:`."
